  "The module empowers you to create and manage various pricing conditions tailored to your needs. You can define rules based on factors such as purchase quantity, customer segments, promotional events, and inventory levels. This customization ensures that your pricing strategy is as dynamic and responsive as your business, allowing you to optimize prices for maximum profitability and customer satisfaction.": "Modül, ihtiyaçlarınıza göre uyarlanmış çeşitli fiyatlandırma koşullarını oluşturmanıza ve yönetmenize olanak tanır. ",
